# weak_spool_api.scn — API `takeoff` of a craft that cannot lift (motor health 0.85): the ToF-invalid rule ends the takeoff by a LANDING, the command replies an error
#                      浮けない機体（モータの健全度 0.85）の API `takeoff`: ToF 無効の規則が離陸を LANDING で終わらせ、コマンドは error を返す
#
# Before the ToF-invalid rule the auto-takeoff of such a craft went on at hover thrust + the correction limit for ever (the `takeoff` command replied `error takeoff timeout` after 12 s, the
# motors kept spinning on the floor). With the ToF reading invalid on the floor (the SILS dead zone), the 2 s + 0.15 s time limit of the invalid-sample count makes a ToF-silence
# episode and TAKEOFF -> LANDING (accepted on the floor, the descent thrust cannot lift the craft); the waiting `takeoff` sees the climb aborted and replies
# "error takeoff aborted"; the floor holds the craft ("Touchdown detected") and the motors stop. Spec under test (detailed_design.md §3, operation_manual.md "takeoff that does not lift").
#
# ToF 無効の規則の前は、そのような機体の自動離陸は hover 推力 + 補正の上限のまま続いた（`takeoff` コマンドは 12 s 後に `error takeoff timeout` を返したが、モータは床の上で回り続けた）。
# ToF が床の上で無効を返す（SILS の不感帯）ので、無効サンプルを数える 2 s + 0.15 s の時間の上限が ToF 出力停止のエピソードと TAKEOFF → LANDING を作る（床の上で
# 許容する。降下の推力は機体を持ち上げられない）。待機中の `takeoff` は上昇の中止を見て "error takeoff aborted" を返し、床が機体を支え（"Touchdown detected"）、モータは止まる。
# 検証する仕様（detailed_design.md §3、operation_manual.md の「浮かない takeoff」）。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/weak_spool_api.scn --target vehicle --duration 18000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    fault 0 0.85
   0    fault 1 0.85
   0    fault 2 0.85
   0    fault 3 0.85
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50      # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                          # B: enter SDK mode (t=6)
   +    api        "takeoff"                                          # C: takeoff -> ARM -> spool -> TAKEOFF at about 6.3 s -> LANDING at about 8.6 s, error reply
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     11000     50      # D: wait (to t=17)
